{"path":"biology/cells/structure/membrane-transport","title":"物质跨膜运输方式辨析","type":"example","html":"<p>关于物质跨膜运输的叙述，正确的是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 甘油、乙醇、苯等脂溶性小分子通过自由扩散进出细胞</p>\n<p>B. 葡萄糖进入红细胞的运输方式是主动运输</p>\n<p>C. 离子跨膜运输都必须消耗能量</p>\n<p>D. 抗体分泌出细胞的方式是主动运输</p>\n<ul>\n<li>高频三连辨析：①<strong>葡萄糖</strong>：入红细胞=协助扩散，入小肠上皮细胞、肾小管=主动运输（逆浓度）；②<strong>水分子</strong>：主要是自由扩散，也有水通道蛋白介导的协助扩散；③<strong>神经细胞</strong>：静息时 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{K^+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 外流、兴奋时 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Na^+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 内流=协助扩散；<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Na^+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{K^+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 泵恢复离子浓度=主动运输；</li>\n<li>通道蛋白与载体蛋白：通道蛋白贯穿膜、无构象变化、速度快（协助扩散）；载体蛋白需与物质结合、发生构象变化，可参与协助扩散或主动运输；</li>\n<li>胞吞胞吐依赖<strong>膜的流动性</strong>、需要消耗能量，与细胞膜上蛋白质种类无关——这是&quot;膜结构特点&quot;与&quot;膜功能特性&quot;的交叉考点；</li>\n<li>变式：问&quot;与细胞膜选择透过性无关的是&quot;——选&quot;自由扩散速率与载体无关&quot;这类干扰项时，记住选择透过性主要靠载体蛋白和通道蛋白。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>判据表</strong>（每个选项对号入座）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>载体/通道</th>\n<th>能量</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>典型实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>自由扩散</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>不耗</td>\n<td>顺浓度</td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{O_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、甘油、乙醇、苯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协助扩散</td>\n<td>载体或通道蛋白</td>\n<td>不耗</td>\n<td>顺浓度</td>\n<td>葡萄糖入红细胞、<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Na^+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 经通道内流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主动运输</td>\n<td>载体蛋白</td>\n<td>消耗</td>\n<td>逆浓度</td>\n<td>离子泵、葡萄糖入小肠上皮细胞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>胞吞/胞吐</td>\n<td>膜融合</td>\n<td>消耗</td>\n<td>大分子进出</td>\n<td>抗体分泌、白细胞吞噬细菌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li>A：甘油、乙醇、苯都脂溶，直接穿过磷脂双分子层 ⇒ 自由扩散 ✓；</li>\n<li>B：葡萄糖入红细胞是<strong>顺浓度梯度</strong>、经载体蛋白、不耗能 ⇒ 协助扩散，不是主动运输，错；</li>\n<li>C：离子也可经<strong>通道蛋白</strong>顺浓度梯度运输（如神经兴奋时 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Na^+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 内流）⇒ &quot;都必须耗能&quot;错；</li>\n<li>D：抗体是蛋白质大分子，通过<strong>胞吐</strong>分泌 ⇐ 错。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选 <strong>A</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>口诀秒杀</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>&quot;气油醇苯自由，糖进红细协助，逆水行舟主动，大分子胞吞胞吐&quot;</strong>；</li>\n<li>看到&quot;必须/都&quot;字眼先警觉：离子运输<strong>不一定</strong>耗能（有通道就有免能源）；</li>\n<li>抗体、胰岛素、消化酶、神经递质（递质是胞吐！）——分泌蛋白全走胞吐。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>30 秒选 A。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"关于物质跨膜运输的叙述，正确的是（ ） A. 甘油、乙醇、苯等脂溶性小分子通过自由扩散进出细胞 B. 葡萄糖进入红细胞的运输方式是主动运输 C. 离子跨膜运输都必须消耗能量 D. 抗体分泌出细胞的方式是主动运输 高频三连辨析：① 葡萄糖 ：","source":"自编（经典考法）","difficulty":"容易","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"判断运输方式要看\"物质种类+是否需要载体+是否耗能+方向\"四个要素，尤其是\"葡萄糖进红细胞=协助扩散\"\"离子通道=不耗能\"两个高频错点。","fit":["自由扩散/协助扩散/主动运输/胞吞胞吐的区分","细胞膜功能与物质运输","选填题"],"updated":"Mon Mar 03 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"cells","title":"分子与细胞"},{"slug":"structure","title":"细胞结构"},{"slug":"membrane-transport","title":"物质跨膜运输方式辨析"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"cell-structure","title":"细胞的结构与功能","type":"knowledge"}]}